  "description": "Overview An exciting offline hackathon for individual participants in the realm of Program Design. About the Opportunity Get ready to dive into the world of quantum computing with the Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 SRM AP, proudly hosted by SRM University, Amaravati. This offline event is designed for individuals eager to explore and innovate within the fascinating domain of Program Design. This is your chance to engage with cutting-edge technology and showcase your problem-solving prowess. Participants will have the unique opportunity to apply their skills in Program Design in a competitive yet collaborative environment, pushing the boundaries of what's possible. Themes/Problem Statements While exact problems will be revealed to participants, this event focuses on areas related to Program Design. Don't miss this incredible offline opportunity to participate in the Qiskit Fall Fest 2026 SRM AP and make your mark!",
